      "writtenOn": "2014-06-27T20:45:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The LDAP options being set here are library/process global options. What happens when two different connect calls are made which have different options? You\u0027re going to overwrite the previous options and change behavior with unpredictable results. Note that it is now possible to set TLS options on a connection basis instead of globally.",
      "revId": "adfc32861c60eea02884ed3ddfad502f5cc9605e",
      "serverId": "4a232e18-c5a9-48ee-94c0-e04e7cca6543",
      "unresolved": false
    },
